# Perft suite: the move generator's coverage set.
#
# One position per line: <fen> ;D<depth> <leaf nodes> ...
# Every count up to about 1.5M nodes was computed with python-chess 1.11; the
# deeper counts of the standard positions are the published values from the
# chessprogramming wiki (Perft Results) and the widely used perft test sets.
#
# Coverage: the start position, Kiwipete and the other standard positions;
# castling through, out of and into check, and with rooks attacked; en passant
# including discovered check along the rank and a pinned capturer; promotions
# and capture-promotions of every piece; double checks; pins by every slider;
# knight and bishop and rook interplay; stalemate and checkmate; king-only and
# pawn-only endings. Append new positions; never remove or change a line.
